{"version":1,"id":"blake-shelton-god-s-country","title":"God's Country","artist":"Blake Shelton","key":"Cm","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/shelton-blake/gods-country/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Jordan Mark Schmidt, Michael Wilson Hardy and Devin Dawson","chords":[{"symbol":"Cm","canonical":"Cm","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,3,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D#sus2","canonical":"D#sus2","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,5,10],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F","canonical":"F","keyboardPitchClasses":[5,9,0],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Intro]","columns":25,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#sus2","column":12,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":20,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Cm","column":23,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Right outside of this one church town","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"There's a gold dirt road to a whole lot of nothin'","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#sus2","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Got a deed to the land, but it ain't my ground","columns":46,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"This is God's country","columns":21,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"We pray for rain, and thank Him when it's fallen","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause it brings a grain and a little bit of money","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#sus2","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"We put it back in the plate","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"I guess that's why they call it God's country","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":31,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"I saw the light in the sunrise","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Sittin' back in the 40 on the muddy riverside","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#sus2","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Gettin' baptized in holy water and shine","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"With the dogs runnin'","columns":21,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Saved by the sound of the been found","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Dixie whistled in the wind, that'll get you Heaven bound","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#sus2","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"The devil went down to Georgia, but he didn't stick around","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"This is God's country","columns":21,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"We turned the dirt and worked until the week's done","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"We take a break and break bread on Sunday","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#sus2","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"And then do it all again","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause we're proud to be from God's country (Yeah, yeah)","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":30,"beat